          "end": 21.6,
          "en": "simply submit to the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.6,
          "end": 24,
          "en": "But then keep in mind you are creating a single",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24,
          "end": 28.11,
          "en": "page application, so there is no submitting to the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.11,
          "end": 31.74,
          "en": "Instead, you will need to handle the form through Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.74,
          "end": 35.16,
          "en": "And if you then want to submit something to the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.16,
          "end": 39.57,
          "en": "you will need to reach out via Angular's HDP service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.57,
          "end": 42.54,
          "en": "which we'll cover later in the course, to that server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.54,
          "end": 45.24,
          "en": "So you will need to handle your form through Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.24,
          "end": 48.21,
          "en": "and actually Angular will help you handling it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 51.57,
          "en": "because not only will it allow you to get the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.57,
          "end": 54.18,
          "en": "the user entered, it will also allow you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.18,
          "end": 56.37,
          "en": "to check if a form is valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.37,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "It will allow you to conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 61.41,
          "en": "change the way the form is displayed;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
